    "chunk_size_bytes": 1116,
    "chunk_text": "[1.45 p.m.] \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d91\u0dda.\u0d92. \u0dc3\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc7\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b8e\u0bae\u0bcd.\u0b8f. \u0b9a\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba9\u0bcd) (The Hon. M.A. Sumanthiran) Hon. Presiding Member, I wish to welcome the Amendment that is being brought to the Recovery of Loans by Banks (Special Provisions) Act. Parate execution is something that, over the years, we have fought against and my only regret is that it is only being temporarily suspended.\n\n895 896\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd4\u0dba\u0dcf\u0db0 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dba \u0d9a\u0db1 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf ]\n\n2024 \u0db8\u0dd0\u0dd2 07\n\nSo, it is a welcome move to suspend the operation of the Recovery of Loans by Banks (Special Provisions) Act to recover loans by parate execution temporarily, but I urge the Government to consider removing this power from the banks.\n\nThis is the month of May and on the 01st of May, we heard many thunder from political platforms with regard to workers\u2019 rights. In fact, they were not speaking so much about workers\u2019 rights, but about their own political parties and what they would do this year being an election year, as the President has declared."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2020s",
