    "md5": "9d180f26d71c628ba1bb9ef6fddc2c0a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1278,
    "chunk_text": "Sir, I seek approval of Parliament for the implementation of immunities and privileges agreed for the International Centre for Research in Agroforestry - ICRAF- and the Global Green Growth Institute - GGGI - and the Agreement to be acceded with the International Atomic Energy Agency - IAEA - on the Privileges and Immunities of the IAEA.\n\n1039 1040\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0\n\nGiven the above, Sri Lanka has signed Host Country Agreements with the ICRAF on 14th September, 2022 and with the GGGI, on 07th February, 2023. Sri Lanka also intends to accede to the Agreement on the Privileges and Immunities of the IAEA. That is, the International Atomic Energy Agency. In order to give effect to the provisions relating to privileges and immunities in the Agreements signed with ICRAF and the GGGI and the IAEA Agreement to be acceded to, I, Minister of Foreign Affairs, by Orders in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2348/48 dated 08th September, 2023 published the said provisions in keeping with Section 4 of the Diplomatic Privileges Act, No. 09 of 1996. Also, in keeping with Section 5 of the Diplomatic Privileges Act, No. 09 of 1996, the provisions relating to the privileges and immunities published by the Orders are now placed before Parliament for approval."
