    "chunk_index": 71,
    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "4f0c19b28c1ff6b6e478c931bb733255",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2179,
    "chunk_text": "The IAEA was established as an autonomous international organization under the UN system on 29th July, 1957 and Sri Lanka has been a founding member since 1957. Though established independently of the United Nations, through its own international Treaty, the IAEA reports to both the United Nations General Assembly and the Security Council and is headquartered in Vienna, Austria.\n\nThe programmes of the IAEA encourage the development of peaceful application of nuclear energy, science and technology, safeguard against misuse of nuclear technology and nuclear materials and promote nuclear safety and security standards including radiation protection and their implementation.\n\nHon. Deputy Speaker, it has become difficult to get IAEA experts and organize training courses, meetings and workshops in Sri Lanka as Sri Lanka is not a State Party to the Agreement on Privileges and Immunities of the IAEA. So, the following would be the expected benefits of becoming a State Party - we are doing it today - to the Agreement on Privileges and Immunities of the IAEA: (a) provide and receive credible assurance regarding the peaceful nature of nuclear programmes; (b) enhance transparency, build confidence and facilitate peaceful nuclear cooperation; (c) keep control over nuclear materials and nuclear activities conducted in Sri Lanka under the control of the Government by adopting a system that accounts for and controls nuclear materials and (d) demonstrate Sri Lanka\u2019s strong commitment to the global non-proliferation regime.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc1 \u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0db1\u0dd2, \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0dcf\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dc1 \u0dba\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dba \u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0db8\u0dd4\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dcf\u0dc4 \u0dc0\u0dba\u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0daf \u0da7\u0dc1\u0dad\u0dca, \u0dca \u0dad\u0db1 3\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dbd\u0dcf\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dc1 \u0dcf\u0dae\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dd2\u0dad \u0dbb\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dda\u0db8 \u0dcf\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf, \u0d94\u0dc0\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dca\u0da7 \u0d85\u0dc0 \u0dba \u0db8\u0dd4\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dbd\u0db6\u0dcf \u0da2\u0db8 \u0dcf\u0db3\u0dc4\u0dcf \u0d85\u0db4\u0dd2 \u0d9a\u0da7\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8 \u0d9a\u0dba \u0dad\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db6\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dcf. \u0d85\u0db4\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dda \u0d9a\u0da7\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8 \u0d85\u0db8\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dba\u0dcf\u0dcf \u0dc4\u0dd0\u0dd2 \u0da7 \u0d9a\u0da7\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8 \u0d9a\u0dba\u0db1 \u0dc1\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7 \u0d94\u0dc0\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dca \u0dcf\u0db8\u0d9f \u0db8\u0dca \u0dd2\u0dab\u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0db8\u0d9a\u0da7 -Status Agreement"
