    "chunk_size_bytes": 1985,
    "chunk_text": "(ii) Before issuance of permanent certificates, inspection of the service locations is mandatory and permanent/formal registration certificates and licences are issued only to those establishments, which are recommended by the Field Inspection Officers after certifying that those locations have been set up as per the relevant guidelines. Temporary registration has been stopped from 01.01.2024 and permanent/formal registration certificates will be issued to the institutes recommended after a field inspection and if there are major shortcomings due to which registration cannot be recommended, a field inspection will be carried out after they are rectified and further action will be carried out accordingly. In the event that minor shortcomings need to be corrected for the recommendation, temporary registration will be done for a very short time until they are corrected.\n\n(iii) Answers are given in the answer No. (ii)\n\nabove.\n\n(iv) Field Inspection Officers\n\nThe field inspections are conducted by a team selected from among the members of the Sri Lanka Hotel School Graduates Association and two officers each are employed for the field inspections. The services of those officers are taken for a period of one year and evaluations have been done at the end of one year. New officers will be re-selected through an interview based on the recommendations of the Sri Lanka Hotel School Graduates' Association to replace the officers who leave during the evaluation. The list of officers currently employed is given in Annex 08*.\n\nVehicles used in field inspections\n\nThe vehicles in the institute\u2019s pool are used for field inspections and a list of them has been given in Annex 09*. As these vehicles are used for the functions of the entire institution, in cases where field inspections are not sufficient, vehicles are obtained on rent via the online system upon the approval of the institution.\n\n1355 1356\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca \u200d\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2 \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]"
  },
