    "chunk_size_bytes": 2140,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd2\u0da5 \u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd4\u0dc6\u0db1 \u0dc4\u0d9a\u0dd3\u0db8\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bb0\u0ba3\u0bbf \u0bb1\u0bb5\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd \u0bb9\u0b95\u0bc0\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. Rauff Hakeem, Attorney-at-Law) Sir, one has to sing for his supper, is that not so? You see, as the State Minister of Foreign Affairs, he has to sing for his supper. The President is the provider. Therefore, he has to sing his praises. So, we do understand that. - [Interruption.] There is no problem, Hon. State Minster.\n\nSir, this is white supremacism and settler colonialism that is taking place; it is a settler colonialist, white supremacist project to see that the entire Middle East is always kept in turmoil. They are the people who killed all those poor Jews in hundreds of thousands. Not only under Hitler, but several years before Hitler, they started killing Jews in their hundreds of thousands. All that was done by the same white supremacists. Now, they want to wash off all their sins and that is why they went and agreed to this horrendous plan.\n\nNow, Sir, look at the plan. When you look at these documents I have here with me, you can see what has happened to Israel. This document shows how Israel was in 1917 and how the entire land area expanded by 1948. Then,we can see how it further expanded by 1995 and finally, their land area at present. After Trump\u2019s conceptual map, we see that the Palestinian Territory has been shrunk to small pockets. The Palestinians have been pushed into such desperation, but still, Israel keeps on grabbing lands.\n\nSir, I am tabling* this Report titled \"State of Palestine: Israeli settlements in the Occupied Palestinian Territory, including East Jerusalem, and the Occupied Syrian Golan\".\n\nSir, this is a document produced by the Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights. See how Israeli settlements are spread all over the\n\n1679 1680\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dc0\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0ba8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0"
  },
