    "md5": "3c89ab0196aed4e6af6cb3bd7c4ca4d7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1820,
    "chunk_text": "Sir, this is a document produced by the Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights. See how Israeli settlements are spread all over the\n\n1679 1680\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dc0\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0ba8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nSir, I must say that even the other States around the war zone must also stand up and call the bluff. There is no point in having diplomatic relations. They cite the Abraham Accords and various other things and try to somehow curry favour with the US imperialists because they are also depending on them for some supplies. Then, see how bravely the Iranians replied to Israel by sending those missiles; they did not bother. \u0db6\u0dbd\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dca\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dc1\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca \u0dba\u0dd4\u0dda\u0db0\u0dba\u0da7 \u0d87\u0dbb\u0dba\u0dd4\u0db8 \u0dc1\u0dbd\u0dc3 Israel bombed the Iranian Embassy in Syria; that was an invitation to war. The Iranians were very strategic. The Iranian President and their military officials retaliated so as to say, \"We can strike you, Israel. However much you try to have your own Iron Dome and various other things, we have the power to strike you, if we want to.\" They taught them a lesson. Thereafter, Israel is now silent because they do not want a regional war. If a regional war starts, then what happens?\n\nSee what is happening in Ukraine. Who started the war? It was, again, Biden and his party. The entire US administration has to be responsible for what is happening to Ukrainians. They try to bring President Putin before the International Criminal Court, but have no guts to question Netanyahu; only President Putin is a war criminal. What about Netanyahu? What is this double standard? That is what we are asking."
