    "chunk_text": "It is also important to note that there is a complicit arrangement between Hamas and the State of Israel, much the same way the Easter Sunday bombings happened in this country. It is always useful for leaders of countries whose popularity is dipping to show an enemy of the State and then become popular on that. This is the most heinous way of remaining in power. We have seen that happening in our country, too. But, what is happening in Palestine is being exposed by the right-thinking people in the western nations today, not only those in the western nations, but also by the right-thinking Jewish people. I have seen a video of a Holocaust survivor who says, \u201cNot in my name, not in our name\u201d and he explains how what is happening today is very similar to what he and others had to undergo under the Nazi regime. He cites similarities and says, \u201cHow can I support this? This cannot be done in my name.\" Yes, the Holocaust was a horrible thing that happened to the Jews. But, what they are doing now to the people in Palestine is exactly similar.\n\nWhat is happening today is so sad that a race which was almost annihilated - six million of them perished - and which gave rise to the concept of genocide themselves are now doing this to the others. This must stop. And, we, so far away from that theatre, are concerned and we must be concerned. That is not an internal affair of Israel, as much as what happened in this country is not an internal affair of Sri Lanka. When international crimes are committed, it is an international concern. We are hypocritical when we say what happened in Sri Lanka is an internal matter for Sri Lanka,\n\n1697 1698\n\n2024 \u0db8\u0dd0\u0dba\u0dd2 1\n\nbut what happens in Palestine is not an internal matter for Israel. That is also a doublespeak I want to expose, not only the doublespeak of the West."
