    "md5": "b85b846d862f6e4dc752e58ed2836487",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2183,
    "chunk_text": "Sir, the UN Secretary-General Ant\u00f3nio Guterres released a statement this morning and I wish to quote from it.\n\n\u201cThe Security Council just approved a long-awaited resolution on Gaza, demanding an immediate ceasefire, and the immediate and unconditional release of all hostages.\n\nAs has been stated, Sir, there are tens and thousands of internally displaced people - IDPs. There are over six million Palestinians living as refugees in other countries. What they are saying today is, \u201cAn eye for an eye and a tooth for a tooth\u201d. However, this is not going to do any good for world peace as the great Mahatma Gandhi once said. He said, I quote:\n\n\u201cLive as if you were to die tomorrow. Learn as if you were to live forever. An eye for an eye will only make the whole world blind\u201d.\n\n\u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dd6\u0db4\u0daa \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0db4 \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1 \u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca \u0d85\u0dc0\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dae\u0dcf\u0dc1 \u0d8a\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dbd \u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc1\u0d86 \u0dc4\u0db8\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf \u0dc3\u0dd6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca \u0dc1\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dbb\u0dc6\u0dcf \u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba\u0db1 \u200d\u0dbb\u0dc1\u0dda \u0dba\u0da7 \u0d9c\u0db8\u0db1\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1 they are planning on further escalation of the war in Rafah. Over 1.3 million people are living in that area. President Biden of the United States says that he would not support Israel with US weapons, if any further infiltrations are carried out into areas such as Rafah. However, Sir, we see, as I said before, further escalation of hostilities and further loss of human lives. Therefore, we really cannot allow this to go on. If we need to have peace, I think the international community has to band together and have ceasefire agreements entered into, not just between Israel and Palestine, but also to stop the escalating war situation between Ukraine and Russia.\n\nSir, I also wish to bring to the notice of Parliament that the SriLankan Airlines - I heard the Hon. Minister also mentioning this - is going to have an agreement with Mahan Air of Iran. There are sanctions imposed on all Iranian companies and even on Mahan Air. So, if the SriLankan Airlines enters into any agreement with Mahan Air, then the SriLankan Airlines would also have to face sanctions from the United States of America."
  },
  {
