    "chunk_text": "happened in World War II; what is ironic about it is, Jews were persecuted in the Holocaust and it is happening again. Apartheid happened in South Africa and it is now happening in the Middle East. Therefore, as responsible human beings around the world, we all have to stand up for justice, what is right and what is wrong.\n\nSir, while it is true that we are talking of a two-State solution, what does it mean in practise? We have to have a practical two-State solution. Some countries are against it, particularly the United States. I am sorry to say that because the United States is a country I like and is a global leader. Is the United States vetoing this Resolution because they think that by making Palestine a full member of the UN, it would then have the status for creating a two-State solution? So, I think it is time for the US to speak to its colleagues in the UN Security Council and when it is put to vote the next time, for the umpteenth time, to look at it from a perspective of equality for all the people. I hope they would see facts for what they are. Thank you very much, Sir.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf \u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0db8\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0db8\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) Hon. (Dr.) Harsha de Silva, I want to mention that the matter you raised before your speech is a serious violation of the Standing Orders and Privileges. So, I will refer it to the Hon. Speaker. But, according to the Standing Orders, you will have to raise it on the next Sitting Day before the main Business starts since Parliament has now been adjourned and this is an Adjournment Debate which is going on. I checked it up in the Standing Orders.\n\nThe next speaker is the Hon. Madhura Withanage. Order, please! Before he starts, will an Hon. Member propose the Hon. Wasantha Yapabandara to the Chair?\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dad\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0d9a \u0db6\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dc3\u0dd6\u0dd2\u0db4\u0dba \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95 \u0baa\u0bbe\u0bb2\u0b9a\u0bc2\u0bbe\u0bbf\u0baf) (The Hon. Tharaka Balasuriya) Sir, I propose that the Hon. Wasantha Yapabandara do now take the Chair."
  },
